<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's PZ Industries Q3 profits steady.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's PZ Industries Q3 profits steady.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for conglomerate Paterson and Zochonis (PZ) Industries Nigeria Plc ended February 28, 1997. (In million naira unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>				1997	  1996</p>
<p> Turnover		   11,331  vs 10,833</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  1,650  vs  1,630</p>
<p> Taxation			528  vs    521</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   1,122  vs  1,108</p>
</text>
